# Replay the recorded large Practice surface failure with the current host.
# Launch at 1500x1200; macOS may constrain the actual window to its work area.
settle 90
ui-zoom 0.75
act mere-example
settle 5
click .workspace-panel Practice
settle 5
assert snap set-cards == 2
capture 01_practice
click .workspace-panel Mere
settle 5
assert snap overview-active == true
capture 02_mere
